{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"HUMAN"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"How to upgrade from v3"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/human\/how_to_upgrade_from_v3"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/human\/how_to_upgrade_from_v3"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Bye bye PerimeterX… Hello HumanSecurity","anchor":"Bye-bye-PerimeterX-Hello-HumanSecurity"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK name was changed from PerimeterX to HUMAN"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Android: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import com.humansecurity.mobile_sdk.HumanSecurity"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iOS: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import HUMAN"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In Android you should change your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"build.gradle"},{"type":"text","text":" file to you the new SDK repo location: https:\/\/jfrog.humansecurity.com\/artifactory\/human-android-sdk\/"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The main class was renamed from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PerimeterX"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HumanSecurity","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All SDK’s classes now have "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HS"},{"type":"text","text":" as a prefix to their name instead of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PX"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some functions in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PerimeterX"},{"type":"text","text":" were moved to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HSBotDefender","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HSAccountDefender","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" classes according to their context."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PerimeterXDelegate"},{"type":"text","text":" has been renamed to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HSBotDefenderDelegate","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Error query functions were combined into "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HSBotDefender\/errorType(error:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" function."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Android’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HSTimeoutInterceptor"},{"type":"text","text":" class was removed, you can set the different timeouts directly in the okHttp client config."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"The policy","anchor":"The-policy"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Previously the policy object was a one-level object that includes all SDK’s configurations."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Now the policy object includes the following objects:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HSAutomaticInterceptorPolicy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" - “Automatic Interceptor” configurations.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HSHybridAppPolicy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" = “Hybrid App” configurations.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HSDetectionPolicy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" - Configurations regarding the SDK’s detection.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HSDoctorAppPolicy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" - “Doctor App” configurations.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Previously you had to set your server(s) domain(s) for both the “Automatic Interceptor” and “Hybrid App”. Now, there are two different functions for each of them."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Bot Defender","anchor":"Bot-Defender"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Previously the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HSBotDefender\/headersForURLRequest(forAppId:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" function returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"null"},{"type":"text","text":" when you call it before calling the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HumanSecurity\/start(appId:policy:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" function."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Now this function will always return a value (not empty). However, It’s mandatory to call it "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"after","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" calling the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HumanSecurity\/start(appId:policy:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" function."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Hybrid App","anchor":"Hybrid-App"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In order to enable “Hybrid App”, you should call the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HSHybridAppPolicy\/set(webRootDomains:forAppId:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" function. Notice that you should set the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"web root domain","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".example.com"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"New in iOS","anchor":"New-in-iOS"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HumanSecurity\/setupWebView(webView:navigationDelegate:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" function allows to do the “Hybrid App” integration manually, unlike the automatic way that was only available in previous versions."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HSHybridAppPolicy\/automaticSetup","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is an option to enable the same “Hybrid App” automatic integration that was available in previous versions."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Environment","anchor":"Environment"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Android","anchor":"Android"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK is now built for API 34 and 